  "description": "APPLICATION\r\nFOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS) OF LBM REF: 21/P4135 (PREVIOUSLY\r\nVARIED BY 23/P0220) FOR THE PROPOSED PART CHANGE OF USE OF MIXED-USE BUILDING\r\nFROM EDUCATION [CLASS F1], OFFICE AND RETAIL [CLASS E] TO MIXED-USE BUILDING\r\nCOMPRISING HOTEL [CLASS C1], AND COMMERCIAL, BUSINESS AND SERVICE [CLASS E].\r\nPARTIAL DEMOLITION AND REBUILD OF EXISTING GROUND FLOOR SHOPFRONT ON ALWYNE\r\nROAD. INSTALLATION OF NEW SHOPFRONTS ON WIMBLEDON HILL ROAD. ERECTION OF SINGLE\r\nSTOREY REAR EXTENSION TO PROVIDE REFUSE AND CYCLE STORAGE FACILITIES, INCLUDING\r\nINSTALLATION OF PLANT EQUIPMENT AND ASSOCIATED WORK. PLEASE SEE COVERING LETTER\r\nFOR PROPOSED AMENDMENTS.&nbsp;",
